            <figure><img src="{{ 'ss-home-sapphire-hoodie.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Sapphire Shooters navy hoodie" width="800" height="800" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Team hoodies</figcaption></figure>
            <figure><img src="{{ 'ss-demo-polo.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Cashmere Youth Football white Under Armour polo" width="600" height="600" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Coaches polos</figcaption></figure>
            <figure><img src="{{ 'ss-home-sapphire-tee.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Sapphire Shooters navy adult T-shirt" width="800" height="800" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Everyday tees</figcaption></figure>
            <figure><img src="{{ 'ss-demo-hat.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Sapphire Shooters navy and white team hat" width="600" height="600" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Team hats</figcaption></figure>
            <figure><img src="{{ 'ss-demo-tote.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Sapphire Shooters black tote bag" width="600" height="600" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Grab-and-go totes</figcaption></figure>
          </div>
          <p class="ad-gear-note">Gear shown from Cashmere Youth Football &amp; Sapphire Shooters.</p>
        </div>
      </section>
      <div class="ss-home-slot" data-ss-home-slot="reviews"></div>
      <section class="ad-section ad-play-section" id="ad-try-{{ section.id }}">
        <div class="ad-wrap">
          <p class="ad-kicker">Go ahead. Make it yours.</p>
          <h2>This is the fun part.</h2>
          <p class="ad-section-intro">Try a name and number. Then explore how you can choose the gear and colors in your own store.</p>
          <div class="ad-experience">
            <div class="ad-experience-tabs" role="group" aria-label="Choose a feature to try">
              <button type="button" data-ad-demo="personalize" aria-pressed="true">Name &amp; number</button>
              <button type="button" data-ad-demo="builder" aria-pressed="false">Pro Builder</button>
            </div>
            {%- comment -%}BC3413 calibration and Varsity Prime settings from Pro Builder. Use the product-page renderer so this demo follows its sizing and outlines.{%- endcomment -%}
            <div data-ad-demo-panel="personalize" class="ad-demo-layout" data-ss-pers
              data-initial-color="Athletic Grey Triblend"
              data-font-family="Graduate" data-font-weight="400" data-font-style="normal"
              data-ink-fit="true" data-ink-stroke-ratio="0.045" data-name-stroke-min="0.06" data-name-stroke-cap="0.12"
              data-color-hex="#ffffff" data-outline-color-hex="#1e2a4a" data-outline-ratio="0.035"
              data-max-name="14" data-max-number="3"
              data-bbox-left="29.7" data-bbox-top="8.1" data-bbox-width="41.1" data-bbox-height="54.6"
              data-top-offset-pct="0.10" data-lift-pct="0" data-center-alone="0"
              data-name-zone-pct="0.28" data-name2-zone-pct="0.21" data-line-gap-pct="0.02" data-gap-pct="0.04" data-number-min-share="0.20"
              data-mockups-url="https://printfulautomation-production.up.railway.app/editor/pro-shirt/bc3413/mockups-public">
              <div class="ad-print-stage">
                <canvas data-ss-pers-canvas width="640" height="640" role="img" aria-label="Live back preview of an athletic grey tri-blend shirt with your name and number in white with a navy outline">Try your name and number on a tri-blend shirt.</canvas>
                <span class="ad-demo-badge">Tri-blend tee · Live back preview</span>
              </div>
              <div class="ad-demo-controls">
                <p class="ad-demo-eyebrow">You choose the design. Parents do the rest.</p>
                <h3>One team look.<br>Every name their own.</h3>
                <p>In Pro Builder, pick the name &amp; number design, font, inside color and outline color. Add the shirt to your team store and share the link.</p>
                <p>Parents choose their size, enter their own name and number on the product page, preview it, then check out. No roster or individual orders for you to manage.</p>
                <p class="ad-demo-fine"><strong>Try it as a parent:</strong> type a name and number below.</p>
                <div class="ad-personal-fields"><label>Name<input type="text" data-ss-pers-name value="ADILYN" maxlength="14" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" aria-label="Try a name on the tri-blend shirt"></label><label>Number<input type="text" data-ss-pers-number value="7" maxlength="3" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Try a number on the tri-blend shirt"></label></div>
                <div class="ad-print-style"><strong>Varsity Prime</strong><span><i class="ad-print-swatch ad-print-swatch-white" aria-hidden="true"></i>White inside</span><span><i class="ad-print-swatch ad-print-swatch-navy" aria-hidden="true"></i>Navy outline</span></div>
                <p class="ad-demo-fine">Same preview used on our product pages. This example shows the design selected by the store organizer; parents personalize the name and number.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div data-ad-demo-panel="builder" class="ad-demo-layout" hidden>
