                <img data-ad-builder-image src="{{ 'ss-home-sapphire-tee.webp' | asset_url }}" width="800" height="800" alt="Sapphire Shooters navy T-shirt" loading="lazy"
                  data-tee-navy="{{ 'ss-home-sapphire-tee.webp' | asset_url }}" data-tee-white="{{ 'ss-demo-tee-white.webp' | asset_url }}" data-tee-gray="{{ 'ss-demo-tee-gray.webp' | asset_url }}"
                  data-hoodie-navy="{{ 'ss-home-sapphire-hoodie.webp' | asset_url }}" data-hoodie-white="{{ 'ss-demo-hoodie-white.webp' | asset_url }}" data-hoodie-gray="{{ 'ss-demo-hoodie-gray.webp' | asset_url }}">
                <span class="ad-demo-badge">Sapphire Shooters · Example store</span>
              </div>
              <div class="ad-demo-controls">
                <p class="ad-demo-eyebrow">For the person running the store</p>
                <h3>You're the creative director.</h3>
                <p>Pick the gear. Choose the colors. Keep adding products whenever you want.</p>
                <div class="ad-builder-products" role="group" aria-label="Preview a product"><button type="button" data-ad-product="tee" aria-pressed="true">T-shirt</button><button type="button" data-ad-product="hoodie" aria-pressed="false">Hoodie</button></div>
                <div class="ad-builder-colors" role="group" aria-label="Preview garment color"><button type="button" data-ad-color="navy" aria-pressed="true"><span class="ad-color-dot ad-color-dot-navy" aria-hidden="true"></span>Navy</button><button type="button" data-ad-color="white" aria-pressed="false"><span class="ad-color-dot ad-color-dot-white" aria-hidden="true"></span>White</button><button type="button" data-ad-color="gray" aria-pressed="false"><span class="ad-color-dot ad-color-dot-gray" aria-hidden="true"></span>Gray</button></div>
                <p class="ad-demo-fine" data-ad-builder-status aria-live="polite">T-shirt · Navy</p>
                <p class="ad-demo-fine">A quick Pro Builder demo. Your store's full builder also lets you add artwork and adjust placement.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="ad-play-close">You control the gear. Everyone handles their own order.</p>
          <a class="ad-start ad-play-cta" href="{{ request_url | escape }}">Build my free team store <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
      </section>


      <section class="ad-section">
        <div class="ad-wrap">
          <p class="ad-kicker">Self-service. Start to finish.</p>
          <h2>From team logo<br>to team store.</h2>
          <p class="ad-section-intro">No website to design. No boxes of shirts to buy. Just a simpler way to get your team geared up.</p>
          <ol class="ad-steps">
            <li><span class="ad-step-num">01</span><h3>Add your logo &amp; colors</h3><p>Sign in, add your team name, upload your logo, and choose your colors. About 2 minutes.</p></li>
            <li><span class="ad-step-num">02</span><h3>Your store builds automatically</h3><p>Your logo goes on your gear. Your private store is ready in about 15 minutes, with no setup fee.</p></li>
            <li><span class="ad-step-num">03</span><h3>Make it yours. Share the link.</h3><p>Parents pick their own size and color, pay online, and get their order shipped directly to them.</p></li>
          </ol>
        </div>
