      <div class="ss-home-slot" data-ss-home-slot="catalog"></div>
      <section class="ad-section">
        <div class="ad-wrap ad-faq-wrap">
          <p class="ad-kicker">Good questions</p><h2>Before you start.</h2>
          <details><summary>Is the team store really free?</summary><p>Yes. Creating your store is free, with no setup fee or upfront inventory purchase. Your members pay for the gear they choose to order.</p></details>
          <details><summary>Why do I need to sign in?</summary><p>Secure Shopify sign-in connects your store to your dashboard so you can manage it and return later. After signing in, you come back to the short setup form.</p></details>
          <details><summary>Do I have to collect sizes or payments?</summary><p>No. Share your store's join link. Each person signs in, chooses their own size and color, and pays for their own order. We ship directly to them.</p></details>
          <details><summary>Can I change the gear later?</summary><p>Yes. Your store dashboard lets you add products, choose colors, adjust logo placement, and hide items. Your store can grow with your team.</p></details>
          <details><summary>Is this just for sports teams?</summary><p>Sports teams, clubs, military units, small businesses, and family groups can all create a store. The same simple setup works for each.</p></details>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="ad-final" data-ad-final>
        <div class="ad-wrap"><h2>Your logo.<br>Their new favorite gear.</h2><p>A free team store. A whole lot less work.</p><a class="ad-start" href="{{ request_url | escape }}">Build my free team store <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><p class="ad-veteran">Stella &amp; Sage · Veteran owned and operated</p></div>
      </section>
